# Line endings are LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Every blob in this repo is already stored with LF. Without this file that is
# only true by accident of each contributor's core.autocrlf: on Windows the
# default checks files out as CRLF, so the working tree stops matching the blob
# and diff viewers show a stray CR on every changed line.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
